  "postconditions": [
    "sub_004333E0 leaves each live vehicle slot's AI-settings filename buffer at +0x4794 set (via sub_587DD0) and the +0x4893 reset byte cleared; returns the final slot counter.",
    "sub_004336F0 returns early when a slot's +0x32C8 guard is zero; otherwise it loads driver names into the same +0x4794 buffer and calls the configuration validator for each live slot.",
    "sub_00433B60 appends a new config_entry node to config_list, sets count at +0x28, then always runs ConfigFileParser; returns 1 when insertion is suppressed by the a4 duplicate-guard, 0 otherwise.",
    "sub_00433D60 unlinks and frees every entry whose name at +0x14 matches a2, decrements the +0x28 count, and clears the list string; returns whether the tail string at +0x10 also matched.",
    "sub_00433ED0 sets byte_7C56C0 = 0 and (when a3 is set) rebinds the driver-name strings at this+0x08 when the HDV parse succeeds; returns 0 on success, 1 otherwise.",
    "sub_00433FC0 writes the vehicle setup file through VehicleSetupFileWriter; on failure returns 0 and copies the requested name into the string field at this+0x08 (only when a3 is set).",
    "sub_004348B0 shuts down any existing child at this+0x0C, allocates a new 208-byte transform_3d_motion object, configures its float fields (+0x38=60.0, +0x3C=2.0, +0x48=1.2, +0xA4=2.0, +0xA8=this+0x30), calls its vtable method at +0x1C, and returns 0 on success / 1 on failure.",
    "sub_0044F5F0 destroys and nulls all non-null cursor handles in the six-slot array and clears this[0x2A] (+0xA8); returns the last DestroyCursor result.",
    "sub_0045C0C0 appends one file_entry (12-byte node, size at +0x08) per directory entry passing the selected check into file_list at +0x04..+0x10.",
    "sub_0045D890 returns 1 for handled-and-consumed messages and 0 for unknown ones; per-type side effects include net_session state writes (+0x10, +0x20, +0x378, +0x3FC4), chat/message list appends (+0x3FC8 / +0x1B770), and global writes (byte_8AFF00, dword_7D2E50, dword_83EE54).",
    "sub_0045ECD0 frees every node of the +0x1B780 message list, reloads autochat01..10 text into a fresh list, and returns the result of SubCallWithConditionalFieldFree."
