  "side_effects": [
    "sub_004333E0 builds and probes candidate AI settings files (qual/race + svm variants) and may load them into each live slot; allocates/frees a per-iteration path buffer.",
    "sub_00433B60 allocates a 28-byte config_entry and a 12-byte list_node via OperatorNewNhMallocWrapper and inserts it at the tail; mutates config_list +0x1C/+0x20/+0x24/+0x28.",
    "sub_00433D60 frees matching config_entry nodes and their list_node wrappers, invoking PhysicsObjectDestructor_3e60 when the node flag is set.",
    "sub_00433EB0 resets the shared AI state buffer byte_7C56C0 and clears the string field at this+0x08.",
    "sub_00433ED0 updates the vehicle-stats display buffer byte_7C56C0 and, on success, writes byte_7C56C0 = 0 and rebinds driver-name strings.",
    "sub_004348B0 allocates/frees the gridwalk camera's child transform object and calls its vtable dispatch method.",
    "sub_00448140 stores a2 into this[0], creates an ambient helicopter.wav sound via a vtable+92 call on the manager at dword_8AC4C4, stores it at this[1], and wires a scene-graph node (this[3]) with an attached audio emitter.",
    "sub_0044C0E0 resets the collision tree, initializes the sin table, creates directories, loads a .hat terrain file, builds collision geometry, runs a 32x32 grid raycast, and frees an internal 256-byte path buffer.",
    "sub_0044C4C0 reads the spatial-grid parameters and the query object, mutates the query's +0x30 result-cell field, and may run BVHTreeTraversal on the selected cell.",
    "sub_0044F5F0 clears the system cursor and destroys six loaded cursor resources.",
    "sub_00455290 registers 44 input action names (steer, pedals, gears, clutch, TC/launch, LCD, look, replay, pit, brake bias, and more) through StringCopyWithBufferRealloc.",
    "sub_00456170 writes the sound-emitter vtable pointer 0x59EFAC and resets all emitter fields to defaults.",
    "sub_004562F0 / sub_004572B0 / sub_004585E0 parse key=value config tokens and write parsed values into their object fields at +0x30..+0xAC (+0xB0 path for 0x004585E0); return 0 on clean EOF and 1 on early termination.",
    "sub_00457000 / sub_00457B60 / sub_00459330 copy a source transform/parameter struct into 'this' field-by-field (0x00457B60 squares the +0x88 radius into +0x8C; 0x00459330 deep-copies the movement-path buffer at +0xB0).",
    "sub_0045C0C0 iterates the directory search list unk_8AD3B0, allocates file-entry nodes, and appends them to file_list.",
    "sub_0045D890 dispatches on net message type bits and performs per-type work: session config copy, standings/grid encoding, ready-state copy into flt_5F0774, track-change display, chat append, terrain.ini synchronization, and terrain-surface roughness sampling.",
    "sub_0045ECD0 frees all chat message nodes and reloads up to 10 autochat entries from disk via a Miles audio stream handle, closing the stream with the conditional handle-close dispatch."
